      <logmessage>======================================================================
[CRITICAL ERROR] Failed to connect to the target database!
Timestamp: ${Internal.Job.Execution.Date}
Execution Directory: ${Internal.Job.Filename.Directory}

Target Connection: NeonDB Cloud Database

Potential causes:
1. NeonDB compute endpoint is suspended, idle, or restarting.
2. Network connectivity issue or DNS resolution failure.
3. Invalid database credentials, SSL handshake failure, or expired token.
4. Firewall / IP restrictions blocking outgoing traffic on port 5432.

Pipeline execution aborted before reading any input data or mutating tables.
======================================================================</logmessage>
